>\t<li><b>Salida total<\/b>: Hasta 65 W<\/li>\t<li>Puertos USB-C PD 3.0:2\u00d7 USB-C (hasta 65 W)0: 2\u00d7 USB-C (hasta 65W)<\/li>\t<li>Puerto USB-A QC 3.0: 1\u00d7 USB-A (hasta 18W)<\/li>\t<li>Salida USB-C1\/C2 (admite PPS): 5V\/3A&#65292;9V\/3A&#65292;12V\/3A&#65292;15V\/3A&#65292;20V\/3,25A (65 W m\u00e1x. cada uno), PPS: 5V-20V\/3A.<\/li>\t<li>Salida USB-A QC 3.0: 5V\/3A, 9V\/3A (hasta 18 W).0: 5V\/3A, 9V\/ 2A, 12V\/1,5A (18 W m\u00e1x.)<\/li>\t<li><b>Temperatura de funcionamiento<\/b>: 0\u00b0C a 35\u00b0C<\/li>\t<li><b>Temperatura de almacenamiento<\/b>: 0\u00b0C a 35\u00b0C<\/li>\t<li><b>Humedad de funcionamiento:<\/b> 10% (0\u00b0C) a 85% (35\u00b0C) HR<\/li>\t<li><b>Material<\/b>: Carcasa de pl\u00e1stico: PC + ABS + Material ign\u00edfugo<\/li>\t<li><b>Dimensiones (L x An x Al)<\/b>: 89.5 \u00d7 44 \u00d7 31 mm<\/li>\t<li><b>Peso<\/b>: 92 gramos<\/li>\t<li><b>Sistemas de protecci\u00f3n:<\/b><\/li>\t<li>Protecci\u00f3n contra cortocircuitos<\/li>\t<li>Protecci\u00f3n contra sobretensi\u00f3n<\/li>\t<li>Protecci\u00f3n contra sobrecorriente<\/li>\t<li>Protecci\u00f3n contra sobretemperatura<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/p>                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"VERBATIM","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":24.3,"unit_price_tax":24.3,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Accesorios de SmartPhones","sub_category":"Cargadores Ultrar\u00e1pidos +60W","quantity":0,"brand":"VERBATIM","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_verb-carga%2032353_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":17.3}}},"0023942323549":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0023942323549",false],"wholesale_pri